  "description": "Experience Freedom with the Bull Electric Trike\n\nRevitalize your daily commute and weekend adventures with the Bull Electric Trike. This robust trike doesn't just get you from point A to B; it transforms the way you ride. Imagine gliding effortlessly through town, feeling the wind in your hair while confidently maneuvering through traffic or enjoying a scenic park path. With its sleek design and powerful performance, the Bull Electric Trike ensures that every journey is a stylish one.\n\nEquipped with a 500W DC Brushless motor, the Bull trike offers a maximum speed of 20 MPH, making it perfect for both leisurely rides and quicker trips to your destination. Whether you opt for throttle-only cruising or pedal-assisted travel, you can achieve a remarkable range of up to 60 miles, ensuring you go the distance without worry. Plus, with charging times between 4 to 6 hours, you’ll be back on the road in no time.\n\nDesigned for comfort and convenience, the Bull Electric Trike features a spacious rear basket for your personal items and is perfect for recreational activities like grocery runs or day trips. The adjustable seat height guarantees that riders of all sizes will find their perfect fit.\n\nDon’t just ride—make a statement with the Bull Electric Trike. Discover the freedom of electric riding today!",
